(documentation FlexorPollicisBrevisMuscle EnglishWrittenLanguage "The &%FlexorPollicisBrevisMuscle performs &%Flexion of  &%Thumb.")
(antagonistMuscles ExtensorPollicisLongusMuscle FlexorPollicisBrevisMuscle)
(antagonistMuscles ExtensorPollicisBrevisMuscle FlexorPollicisBrevisMuscle)

