(termFormat EnglishWrittenLanguage SuperficialBranchOfUlnarNerve "superficial branch of ulnar nerve")
(documentation PalmarisBrevisMuscle EnglishWrittenLanguage "The &%PalmarisBrevisMuscle wrinkle skin of palm.")

